{"title": "LTO Tape Brand Guide - Who Really Makes Your Tapes", "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen\"><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary text-primary-foreground py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag h-12 w-12\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-factory h-12 w-12\"><path d=\"M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M17 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M7 18h1\"></path></svg></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">LTO Tape Brand Guide</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl opacity-90 mb-4\">Understanding Who Really Makes Your Tapes</p><p class=\"text-lg opacity-80\">The secret behind LTO tape brands: Only two companies manufacture the tape inside every cartridge</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-2xl flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-factory h-7 w-7 text-primary\"><path d=\"M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M17 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M7 18h1\"></path></svg>The Manufacturing Secret</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-base\">When purchasing LTO tape media, the most important \"secret\" to understand is that <strong>very few companies actually manufacture the tape</strong>.</p><p class=\"text-base\">While you will see many brands on the shelf (HPE, IBM, Quantum, Dell), the physical tape inside the plastic cartridge is manufactured by only <strong>two companies: Fujifilm and Sony</strong>.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-muted py-16\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-center\">The Major LTO Brands</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-center mb-8\">Virtually identical in technical performance - they all adhere to LTO Consortium standards</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-2 border-primary\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl text-primary\">The Manufacturers (The Source)</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-4\"><div class=\"p-4 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 bg-primary\">#1</div><h4 class=\"font-bold\">Fujifilm</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The dominant market leader. They manufacture the vast majority of LTO media globally.</p></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-secondary/10 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80\">#2</div><h4 class=\"font-bold\">Sony</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The secondary manufacturer. They have historically battled Fujifilm over patent lawsuits but remain the only other alternative for modern tape generations.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl\">The Re-branders (The Vendors)</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-3\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-muted/50 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">HPE (Hewlett Packard Enterprise)</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Very popular, often carries a price premium. They rebrand Fujifilm or Sony tapes.</p></div><div class=\"p-3 bg-muted/50 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">IBM</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Highly trusted, usually rebrands Fujifilm.</p></div><div class=\"p-3 bg-muted/50 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Quantum</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Common in media/entertainment sectors.</p></div><div class=\"p-3 bg-muted/50 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Dell / Lenovo</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Less common to see sold separately, but they exist as rebranded stock.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-center\">The Differences (What You're Actually Paying For)</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-center mb-8\">Since the underlying magnetic tape is often identical (e.g., an HPE LTO-8 tape is likely a Fujifilm tape with an HPE sticker), why do prices differ?</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg>Brand Tax</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">HPE and IBM typically charge more (10\u201320% premium) because of their brand reputation and validation testing.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Warranty &amp; Support</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">This is the biggest practical difference. If you have an HPE tape drive and it fails, HPE support is less likely to blame the \"media\" if you are using HPE-branded tapes. If you use a generic Sony tape in an HPE drive, support might try to blame the tape to close the ticket.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg>Pre-Labeling</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Some brands (like HPE \"Tri-Optic\" or IBM) offer cartridges that come pre-labeled with barcodes. \"Generic\" Fujifilm/Sony tapes usually do not, requiring you to buy and stick labels yourself.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-factory h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M17 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M7 18h1\"></path></svg>Packaging</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Some brands sell \"Library Packs\" (20 tapes in a plastic tray, no individual cases) which are cheaper and faster to load into robots.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-muted py-16\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-center\">Price &amp; Spec Cheat Sheet (LTO-3 to LTO-10)</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-center mb-8\">Prices are estimates based on the current market (January 2026). \"Compressed\" capacity assumes a 2.5:1 ratio.</p><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Legacy / End-of-Life (Hard to find new)</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">These tapes are cheap if you buy used, but \"New Old Stock\" can be surprisingly expensive due to scarcity.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-auto\"><table class=\"w-full caption-bottom text-sm\"><thead class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Generation</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Native Capacity</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Major Brand Price (New)</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Budget Brand Price (New)</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-3</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">400 GB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$30 - $50</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$15 - $20</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground\">Obsolete</div></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-4</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">800 GB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$35 - $60</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$20 - $25</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground\">Obsolete</div></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-5</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">1.5 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$30 - $45</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$20 - $25</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80\">Legacy (Common)</div></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-6</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">2.5 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$40 - $55</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$30 - $35</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80\">Legacy (Common)</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8 border-2 border-primary\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">Modern Standard (Readily Available)<div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 bg-primary\">Recommended</div></h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The \"sweet spot\" for most businesses today.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-auto\"><table class=\"w-full caption-bottom text-sm\"><thead class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Generation</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Native Capacity</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Major Brand Price (New)</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">OEM Price (Fuji/Sony)</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-7</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">6 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$60 - $80</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$50 - $60</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Lowest cost per TB for smaller archives.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50 bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-7 Type M</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">9 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">N/A</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">N/A</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">This is actually an LTO-7 tape formatted in an LTO-8 drive.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50 bg-primary/10\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-bold\">LTO-8 \u2b50</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">12 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$90 - $110</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$70 - $85</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-sm font-medium\">Excellent value; standard for most IT backups.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">LTO-9</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">18 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$140 - $170</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">~$110 - $130</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">High density; longer initialization time required.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-2 border-green-500\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">Bleeding Edge (New Release)<div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 bg-green-500\">New</div></h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">As of early 2026, this is the newest technology just hitting the market.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-auto\"><table class=\"w-full caption-bottom text-sm\"><thead class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Generation</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Native Capacity</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Estimated Price</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-bold\">LTO-10</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">30-40 TB</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-bold text-primary\">~$250 - $350+</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Just launching. Drives are expensive. Only useful for massive petabyte-scale archives.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Summary Recommendation</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-2 border-green-500\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl text-green-600\">If you want to save money:</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Buy Fujifilm branded tapes. They are the manufacturer, the quality is top-tier (often the exact same tape as IBM/HPE), and they are usually 15-20% cheaper.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-2 border-blue-500\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl text-blue-600\">If you are under a strict support contract:</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Buy the brand that matches your tape drive (e.g., Buy HPE tapes for an HPE StoreEver library) to avoid any potential warranty hassles during hardware support calls.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-muted py-12\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><a href=\"/lto-tape-price-trend\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-md px-8 gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>View Current LTO Tape Prices</button></a></div></div></section></div>"}